// The contract between the operator and the optional control plane
// (0002 §3.4, §5.3, §7.5). The control plane talks only to operators, never
// to engines: one primary stream per cluster, from the elected leader, and
// one events stream per operator replica, for the engines connected to it.
// Enforcement never depends on it: while it is unreachable, engines keep
// their bundles and events wait in the operator's buffers.
//
